        <mxCell id="c91" value="&lt;i&gt;The tab Tests of Product Costs with Test 1 selected and run: the three views of fiscal 2026 for the finished goods, the model&#x27;s revenue and margin beside the workbook&#x27;s. Outlined in teal: the margin and the workbook&#x27;s margin; in coral: the difference, zero for each view. The grid is scrolled one column to the right (Costing View[Order] is out of view). The tab holds 6 tests; the tab Checks holds a row for each value of Requirement 5 (211) and of Milestone 2 (12).&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="704" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
